    <item>
      <title>How generate self signed SSL certificate</title>
      <link>https://yegorov.github.io/posts/how-generate-self-signed-ssl-certificate/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 16 Nov 2026 19:00:00 +0300</pubDate>
      <guid>https://yegorov.github.io/posts/how-generate-self-signed-ssl-certificate/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;Lately, I’ve frequently needed to create self-signed certificates. So, to avoid having to look up the process every single time, I’m posting the commands I use.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h3 id=&#34;generate-rsa-certificate&#34;&gt;&#xA;  Generate RSA certificate&#xA;  &lt;a class=&#34;heading-link&#34; href=&#34;#generate-rsa-certificate&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;i class=&#34;fa-solid fa-link&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34; title=&#34;Link to heading&#34;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&#xA;    &lt;span class=&#34;sr-only&#34;&gt;Link to heading&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-bash&#34; data-lang=&#34;bash&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;openssl genrsa -out example.com.rsa.key &lt;span class=&#34;m&#34;&gt;2048&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;openssl req -x509 -new -nodes -key example.com.rsa.key -sha256 -days &lt;span class=&#34;m&#34;&gt;365&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;se&#34;&gt;\&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;se&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;  -out example.com.rsa.crt &lt;span class=&#34;se&#34;&gt;\&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;se&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;  -subj &lt;span class=&#34;s2&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;/CN=example.com&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;se&#34;&gt;\&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;se&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;  -addext &lt;span class=&#34;s2&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;subjectAltName=DNS:example.com,DNS:*.example.com&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;or with a single command&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-bash&#34; data-lang=&#34;bash&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;openssl req -x509 -newkey rsa:2048 -sha256 -days &lt;span class=&#34;m&#34;&gt;365&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;se&#34;&gt;\&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;se&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;  -nodes -keyout example.com.rsa.key -out example.com.rsa.crt &lt;span class=&#34;se&#34;&gt;\&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;se&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;  -subj &lt;span class=&#34;s2&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;/CN=example.com&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;se&#34;&gt;\&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;se&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;  -addext &lt;span class=&#34;s2&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;subjectAltName=DNS:example.com,DNS:*.example.com&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3 id=&#34;generate-ecdsa-certificate&#34;&gt;&#xA;  Generate ECDSA certificate&#xA;  &lt;a class=&#34;heading-link&#34; href=&#34;#generate-ecdsa-certificate&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;i class=&#34;fa-solid fa-link&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34; title=&#34;Link to heading&#34;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&#xA;    &lt;span class=&#34;sr-only&#34;&gt;Link to heading&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-bash&#34; data-lang=&#34;bash&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;openssl ecparam -name prime256v1 -genkey -noout -out example.com.ec.key&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;openssl req -x509 -key example.com.ec.key -sha256 -days &lt;span class=&#34;m&#34;&gt;365&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;se&#34;&gt;\&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;se&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;  -nodes -keyout example.com.ec.key -out example.com.ec.crt &lt;span class=&#34;se&#34;&gt;\&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;se&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;  -subj &lt;span class=&#34;s2&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;/CN=example.com&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;se&#34;&gt;\&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;se&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;  -addext &lt;span class=&#34;s2&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;subjectAltName=DNS:example.com,DNS:*.example.com&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;or with a single command&lt;/p&gt;</description>
